{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是文化之日。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为待在家里也没事做，所以我跟樱乃出门购物。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃没有什么想要的东西吗？”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟哥哥在一起的时间，无价。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1042", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又说这种让我高兴的话。”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“试着扮演讨人喜欢的妹妹。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1043", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃不用演就是讨人喜欢的妹妹了。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“才不是呢。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1044", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她不是想要我赞同讨人喜欢这点。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格没有想要的东西吗？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1045", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟妹妹在一起的时间，无价。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1046", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这种时候……不说讨人喜欢的哥哥吗？”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格就是葛格。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1047", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，说的也是。”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来今天是没有特定目的的逛街了。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你不会想要新衣服之类的东西吗？”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃这个年纪的女孩，好像都会把钱花在那方面。”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“浪费钱是不好的。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1048", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃真是节俭啊。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“输给爱理了。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1049", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们两个都是很罕见的类型。”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为这附近人潮比较多，所以我们牵着手走路。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个避免迷路的行为，从小时候开始就没有改变。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃喜欢什么样的衣服？”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……最近喜欢有边边的。”", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1050", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“边边？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像安洁穿的那种。”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1051", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，边边是指荷叶边啊。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“边边。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1052", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她很坚持这个叫法。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“天羽学姐好像也很适合。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1053", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许吧，那个人感觉就是个大小姐。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“忌妒天羽学姐穿边边的可爱。”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1054", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……总之，你不要一直说边边啦。”", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "擦身而过的人都忍不住回头看她。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格，不想看妹妹的边边吗？”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1055", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一瞬间不知道该做何反应。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请参考看看～”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0440", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "来到车站前，我听见一个熟悉的声音。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思，请参考看看～”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0441", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不禁怀疑自己的眼睛。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是天羽学姐吧？", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么穿成那样……", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请参考看看……”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0442", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她递出一包夹着广告的面纸，我也下意识地收下。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0443", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“天羽学姐。”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1057", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种偶遇，我不知道该做什么反应才好。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她长着翅膀、猫耳……而且居然非常合适。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们两位是出门逛街吗？”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0444", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，想说买点东西。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“天羽学姐在做什么呢？”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我在做发广告面纸的打工喔。”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0445", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我低头看面纸上的广告，上面印了一间在车站附近的女仆咖啡厅的介绍。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁吃茶？”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1058", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐，你在女仆咖啡厅打工吗？”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是，我只是发面纸而已。”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0446", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女仆咖啡厅……很流行。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1059", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，我倒觉得有点退流行了……”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过我很意外。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个像天使一样的天羽学姐，居然会打扮成这样在打工……", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，明明是女仆咖啡厅却没穿女仆装，是经营者的兴趣吗……", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，想要这个。”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1060", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哪个？”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“天羽学姐的边边。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1061", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“边边？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0447", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊！是指学姐穿的衣服啦！”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到学姐说出“边边”两个字我连忙说明。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是这件衣服穿起来有点不好意思呢。站在这种地方又非常显眼……”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0448", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她就是为了招揽客人才站在这里的，这也没办法。不过这套衣服实在很能刺激男人……", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更不用说穿着的人是天羽学姐了。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为认识在学校里温和的学姐，所以更觉得现在的打扮反差很大。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真辛苦，假日还要打工。”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也想赶快结束，然后去社团教室呢～”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0449", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "打工结束后还要去照顾动物吗？", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果不是真心喜欢，是做不到这种程度的吧。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥也来帮忙？”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1062", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不了，身为男生的我帮忙是没有效果的。”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“锁定女性客群。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": "sk1063", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟是女仆咖啡厅，就算偶尔有女孩子去也是少数。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君有去过女仆咖啡厅吗？”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0450", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有，我不太习惯那种店。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，果然跟我想的一样。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0451", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我就在想瓜生君应该是那样。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0452", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来我给她那种感觉吗？", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过隼太倒是很喜欢那种店。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……抱歉，拉着你们聊了这么久。”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0453", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会，我们才是，打扰你打工了。”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 252, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系，跟瓜生君你们聊天很快乐喔～”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 260, "voice": "mu0454", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然场所和服装都不同，但天羽学姐的笑容没有改变。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个人的笑容，才是真的无价。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
